.el .ds Aq '
.TH pcx-passthrough 1  "pcx 0.1.1"
.SH NAME
pcx\-passthrough \- Copy one selected encoded message into a faithful reduced MCAP
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpcx passthrough\fR <\fB\-\-topic\fR> [\fB\-\-frame\fR] [\fB\-\-at\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-compression\fR] [\fB\-\-memory\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT.mcap\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copy one selected encoded message into a faithful reduced MCAP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<TOPIC>\fR
Topic whose encoded messages are selected
.TP
\fB\-\-frame\fR \fI<INDEX>\fR
Zero\-based message index after Topic selection
.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
First message at or after this duration from recording start
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<PATH|\->\fR
Output MCAP path, or \*(Aq\-\*(Aq for binary\-safe stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing output file
.TP
\fB\-\-compression\fR \fI<COMPRESSION>\fR [default: zstd]
Deterministic output chunk compression
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRnone, zstd, lz4]
.TP
\fB\-\-memory\-limit\fR \fI<BYTES>\fR [default: 536870912]
Hard managed\-memory limit in bytes
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT.mcap\fR>
MCAP Source containing the encoded message
